01:07:20.762 --> 01:07:25.183
(indistinct) In school,
we try not to use red meat

01:07:25.183 --> 01:07:26.620
in what we offer.

01:07:26.620 --> 01:07:29.440
And I wanna also thank,
of course Niamh Emerson,

01:07:29.440 --> 01:07:32.204
Lauren Langford, Olivia, and Julissa,

01:07:32.204 --> 01:07:34.430
and everyone who I put
this together today.

01:07:34.430 --> 01:07:35.263
- Thank you.

01:07:35.263 --> 01:07:36.661
- And most of all we wanna thank Sten.

01:07:36.661 --> 01:07:37.619
